# shell: desktop
# A double click is a strict pair, not merely two quick presses on one row.
wait 6
note PVS-010: two presses more than six pixels apart do not open the pose
click 200 116
click 210 116
expect-windows 1

note Control on the second press extends selection instead of opening it
click 700 500
click 200 116
click 200 116 1 ctrl
expect-windows 1

note a secondary second press opens a menu, never the pose
click 200 116
click 200 116 3
wait 2
expect-windows 1
click 700 500

note the same unmodified primary point still opens normally
click 200 116
click 200 116
wait 6
expect-windows 2
quit
